   "body": "Covered by #794 (round 1 of its adversarial review asked for it): a mood now runs to the last `</span>` before what HFR prints after it in the corpus (470 of 470: `div.avatar_center`, `span.TransactionsReportsLink` or `td.messCase2`), and `check` refuses any text or element but a bare `br` between a mood and that element. Whether HFR escapes a mood no longer matters for the fixtures. #794 says `Closes #793`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
